基于 <a href="../core/convert/MappingRedisConverter.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert"><code>MappingRedisConverter</code></a> 的 <a href="HashMapper.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash"><code>HashMapper</code></a>。支持嵌套属性以及简单类型，如
<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang"><code>String</code></a>。

<pre><code>
class Person {

  String firstname;
  String lastname;

  List&lt;String&gt; nicknames;
  List&lt;Person&gt; coworkers;

  Address address;
}
</code>
</pre>

上述内容表示为：

<pre><code>
_class=org.example.Person
firstname=rand
lastname=al'thor
coworkers.[0].firstname=mat
coworkers.[0].nicknames.[0]=prince of the ravens
coworkers.[1].firstname=perrin
coworkers.[1].address.city=two rivers
</code>
</pre>
